    "failed_reliability": "no aggregation or promotion; revise interface or rubric and run a new versioned study",
    "wide_or_degenerate_interval": "report uncertainty; do not substitute an unplanned method to rescue a threshold",
    "threshold_failure": "retain result; do not retune on held-out; revise metric and use a fresh held-out wave"
